{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":483201,"name":"4mvtm7d79h","username":"Jaha","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/j/258eb7/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-04T12:12:32.264Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 11. Grok Bot desktop shows: cannot connect to Grok Bot computer / *.cursorvm.com\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePhone Grok Bot works on the same account.\u003cbr\u003e\nCursor desktop login works.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDNS works:\u003cbr\u003e\nnslookup \u003ca href=\"http://test.us8.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003etest.us8.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e 1.1.1.1\u003cbr\u003e\nreturns IP addresses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo Windows VPN configured.\u003cbr\u003e\nIPv6 DNS failed (no response). Now using 1.1.1.1 only.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease check or rebuild the Agent Computer for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot desktop on Windows 11.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign in with Cursor account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApp shows: cannot connect to Grok Bot computer / *.cursorvm.com\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry does not help.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePhone Grok Bot on the same account works.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop should connect to the Agent Computer like the phone app does.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop for Windows\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: Windows 11\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion: unknown (installed from x.ai/bot)\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483201-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483201-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T12:12:41.369Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":81,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":406.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":170585,"topic_slug":"windows-11-grok-bot-cant-reach-computer-cursorvm-com","display_username":"4mvtm7d79h","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://test.us8.cursorvm.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":6}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136130,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/windows-11-grok-bot-cant-reach-computer-cursorvm-com/170585/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":483243,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-04T12:38:17.641Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, the good news: your Grok Bot computer is fine, and your phone is talking to it normally, so you don’t need to recreate or rebuild anything. That would only reset the working session on your phone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat this looks like: the Grok Bot app on your Windows PC isn’t reaching our servers at all, while Cursor on the same PC connects fine. That usually means something on the PC is handling the two apps differently, most often a proxy, firewall, or antivirus. The \u003ccode\u003e*.cursorvm.com\u003c/code\u003e screen is a generic message for any failed connection attempt, so the DNS checks went in the wrong direction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCan you check these and send back the results?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot: right click the tray icon bottom right and select Quit.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows Settings → Network \u0026amp; Internet → Proxy. Check if Use a proxy server or Use setup script is On. If either is On, Grok Bot doesn’t use that proxy while Cursor does, and that would explain the difference. Temporarily turn it off, or tell me what tool set it up v2ray, Clash, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows Security → Firewall \u0026amp; network protection → Allow an app through firewall. Make sure Grok Bot is allowed for Private and Public. If you have a third party antivirus, add Grok Bot to its exceptions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen PowerShell, run these, and paste the output:\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003ecurl.exe -sI https://api2.cursor.sh\ncurl.exe -sI https://test.us8.cursorvm.com\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\ncurl.exe connects directly just like Grok Bot, so this will show whether direct connections are being blocked.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot again and sign in. If you still see the connection screen, connect your PC to your phone hotspot for a minute and try again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn your reply, include: the proxy setting from step 2, the command output from step 4, whether the hotspot worked, and your Grok Bot version Settings → Updates. That’s enough to pinpoint where the connection is breaking.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T12:38:17.641Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":6.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170585,"topic_slug":"windows-11-grok-bot-cant-reach-computer-cursorvm-com","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/windows-11-grok-bot-cant-reach-computer-cursorvm-com/170585/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":484490,"name":"Oleje32","username":"oleje32","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/oleje32/{size}/120042_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:05:22.395Z","cooked":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484490-same-problem-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484490-same-problem-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSame problem;\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eServer:  one.one.one.one\u003cbr\u003e\nAddress:  1.1.1.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484490-oneoneoneone-cant-find-cursorvmcom-not-implemented-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484490-oneoneoneone-cant-find-cursorvmcom-not-implemented-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e*** one.one.one.one can’t find \u003ca href=\"http://cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e: Not implemented\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e(see attached since I cant add more links)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/9/3/93789a69def9e09502273cc3f9d7c5724f9b1505.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/l2AzUJ06MmIdsq24TIe2XeUA2aN.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/3/93789a69def9e09502273cc3f9d7c5724f9b1505_2_690x353.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"l2AzUJ06MmIdsq24TIe2XeUA2aN\" width=\"690\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/3/93789a69def9e09502273cc3f9d7c5724f9b1505_2_690x353.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/3/93789a69def9e09502273cc3f9d7c5724f9b1505_2_1035x529.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/3/93789a69def9e09502273cc3f9d7c5724f9b15